                        "content": "The nurse is reviewing the laboratory test results for a client with bladder cancer with bone metastasis. The nurse would contact the primary health care provider (PHCP) if which finding is noted?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "11797937e327eb6d913faa80427c566b",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Analyzing 分析",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nHypercalcemia is a serum calcium level greater than 10.5 mg/dL (2.6 mmol/L). It most often occurs in clients who have bone metastasis and is a late manifestation of extensive malignancy. The presence of cancer in the bone causes the bone to release calcium into the bloodstream. Hypercalcemia is an oncological emergency, and the PHCP needs to be notified. Options 2, 3, and 4 indicate normal laboratory values.",
                        "id": "278d73a22ee44191b8c1c7820a527009",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "2ab0dfb66ba747f3abe9d7811e8c422c",
                                "content": "Urinate immediately."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "8ca59d7db2454726928351dd42d6a67d",
                                "content": "Maintain strict bed rest."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "fa31203c79ac4b40a7e5f8baee626a6c",
                                "content": "Change position every 15 minutes."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "597cec2ac08c494e9a94a70430a1f47b",
                                "content": "Retain the instillation fluid for 30 minutes."
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
