                        "difficultyIds": "a0f7d178f7b728b8bba7ef20ddeca62d",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Evaluating 评价",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nThe incidence of bladder cancer is greater in men than in women and affects white people twice as often as black people. The remaining options describe risks associated with bladder cancer.",
