                        "version": 0,
                        "content": "A client who has been receiving radiation therapy for bladder cancer states to the nurse, \"I feel like I am urinating through my vagina.\" The nurse interprets that the client may be experiencing which condition?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "11797937e327eb6d913faa80427c566b",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Analyzing 分析",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nA vesicovaginal fistula is a genital fistula that occurs between the bladder and vagina. The fistula is an abnormal opening between these two body parts; if this occurs, the client may experience drainage of urine through the vagina. The client's complaint is not associated with options 1, 3, or 4.",
                        "id": "b8fba36bdcca43a08b04e92535e14bcc",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "f1b1da3e58954e0598940261b652b37d",
                                "content": "Encourage increased intake of oral fluids."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "d7077a8eaae547709870d31cbd1aee75",
                                "content": "Provide increased doses of opioid analgesics."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "5385f92f8b834ad48bb3f161e58e1ed1",
                                "content": "Place the client on strict contact isolation for 24 hours."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "4d81b7b21ce44f69997ca4f9105d8590",
                                "content": "Keep the client on nothing by mouth (NPO) status for 6 hours."
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "f1b1da3e58954e0598940261b652b37d",
                                    "content": "Encourage increased intake of oral fluids."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "d7077a8eaae547709870d31cbd1aee75",
                                    "content": "Provide increased doses of opioid analgesics."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "5385f92f8b834ad48bb3f161e58e1ed1",
                                    "content": "Place the client on strict contact isolation for 24 hours."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "4d81b7b21ce44f69997ca4f9105d8590",
                                    "content": "Keep the client on nothing by mouth (NPO) status for 6 hours."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
