                        "type": "0",
                        "version": 0,
                        "content": "A cystectomy is performed for a client with a diagnosis of bladder cancer, and a Kock pouch is created for urinary diversion. In creating a discharge teaching plan for the client, the nurse would include which instruction in the plan?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "49d86bb4d5071eb7de614d6c79f7abfb",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Creating创新",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nA Kock pouch is a continent internal ileal reservoir. The nurse instructs the client about the technique of catheterization. Dietary restrictions are not required. There is no external pouch. Antibiotics are not required unless an infection is present; also, antibiotics are prescribed by the health care provider.",
                        "id": "cdba430167a84f958b88178c227b1648",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "6beff884365a4cfda8a8ddd079a03685",
                                "content": "Proteinuria and dysuria"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "898df2e792b64d3e9e71ac6d3c5a54f0",
                                "content": "Hematuria and absence of pain"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "fe4f0c9464e64cfdaf8a621146445d87",
                                "content": "Painful urination and hematuria"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "4d7063af1eb04f93a4fc509e168e1889",
                                "content": "Pyuria and palpable abdominal mass"
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "6beff884365a4cfda8a8ddd079a03685",
                                    "content": "Proteinuria and dysuria"
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "898df2e792b64d3e9e71ac6d3c5a54f0",
                                    "content": "Hematuria and absence of pain"
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "fe4f0c9464e64cfdaf8a621146445d87",
                                    "content": "Painful urination and hematuria"
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "4d7063af1eb04f93a4fc509e168e1889",
                                    "content": "Pyuria and palpable abdominal mass"
                                }
                            ]
